ime\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;t(n)\\ge n+1)\n\\land\\exists M\\in\\{S:\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(S)\\}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(M)\n\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(1^n)\\downarrow=t(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;t(n)\\ge n+1)\n\\land\\exists M\\in\\{S:\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(S)\\}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(M)\n\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(1^n)\\downarrow=t(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Exact clock construction supplies the diagonalization budget used by the deterministic time-hierarchy theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\{1\\}$ and $1^n$ (unary alphabet and word power, see [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])","embed":false},{"ta